### Secrets ###
# Convention (all modules): committed config lives in application.properties
# and application-<env>.properties (no secrets in these — env vars only).
# Anything holding a secret goes in an application-local.* / application-secrets.*
# file or a .env file, all of which are ignored below. Patterns are path-agnostic
# (no leading /), so they apply to every module's src/main/resources equally.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*credentials*.json
application-local.properties
application-local.yml
application-secrets.properties
application-secrets.yml

